  "title": "Sausage Jalapeno Poppers",
  "description": "Jalapeno pepper slices are stuffed with a sausage and cream cheese mixture, then wrapped with bacon. They&#39;re a spicy, mouthwatering party favorite! Secure the bacon with toothpicks.",
  "authors": [
